/v1/","context":{"app_id":3268020,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3268020-1842212951299638","game_id":"steam-3268020","kind":"announcement","title":"Updated DEMO (2026) for Doomsday Valley","summary":"We are finally \"finished\" with the updated demo, enough anyway to be able to say enough is enough and press publish. We would really appreciate all help we can get in testing this new version of the game, as it is the release version but smaller in scope. (For now we only have the Windows version updated but will add MacOS and Linux when we have fixed the bugs being reported.)Upgrades and Change Log▪ The inventory is now \"hover top of the screen\", and we click-drag objects instead of click-hold-","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T10:56:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951299638","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3268020-1835236783560754","game_id":"steam-3268020","kind":"announcement","title":"8-directional walk incoming","summary":"Hello all Doomsday Valley Supernatural Convention Participants As a member of the Bizarre Bulletin community, you are invited to the supernatural convention at Doomsday Hotel. If you like power-infused crystals, fortune-telling and the occasional seance with dead people connecting through the veil, this event is for you! Just sign up at the front desk as you arrive. 8-directional walkOur art department (Karl Längberg) has been stealing a few hours here and there from other duties (usually when t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-11T15:12:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783560754","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3268020-1826992588589300","game_id":"steam-3268020","kind":"announcement","title":"New Cover Art Reveal!","summary":"Hello Supernatural Subscribers! Spring is in the air here in Sweden and we both have just had the yearly cycle of \"sick child -> sick parent -> sick other parent -> sick second child -> repeat ad infinitum\" so it feels like there has been more snot and coughs than actual dev work going on, but we have managed to push the project along a bit anyway.New Cover ArtNow that all the background artwork is 100 % complete - YAY! - we have prioritized a piece of artwork for the game that will go on the St","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-11T08:04:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588589300","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3268020-1819386365089148","game_id":"steam-3268020","kind":"update","title":"December update - Winter is upon us!","summary":"Wintery Greetings all Bizarre Bulletin Subscribers! We are happy to announce that we estimate to be done with 70 % of the background artwork at the end of the year. This is great because we also need to start focus on getting final renders of the different characters. Too bad there is only so much time each day - if someone wants to send us a shipment of coffee (or maybe a babysitter) it might improve the production rate greatly :)The map we did for the Kickstarter campaign is also updated to be","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-18T09:43:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365089148","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3268020-1816849002006910","game_id":"steam-3268020","kind":"update","title":"November update - Camera and Artwork","summary":"November update - Camera and Artwork Dear Doomsday Cult Followers!We have been busy with the development but we also have been making real progress on the background art - we now have around 30 rendered images completed and that is approximately 60 % of the total amount of unique background images. There will be a lot of locations and the locations will have a couple of images each just like the Diner location in the demo is comprised of three background images.All the important systems (Camera,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-19T09:00:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1816849002006910","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3268020-1801617199556083","game_id":"steam-3268020","kind":"announcement","title":"The Last 48 hours are Upon Us!","summary":"In celebration of the last 48 hours we put together a little teaser image from a bus scene that was cut from the demo (the intro would have been too long and slow paced). But we still plan on using it in some capacity in the final game. This scene has parallax effects when the bus moves and it looks quite nice.In this image Maya just lost her phone to one of those pesky mind-controlled squirrels that inhabit this area. If you want the game to be the best version it can be - your support is impor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-10T12:16:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1801617199556083","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3268020-1799088287987112","game_id":"steam-3268020","kind":"announcement","title":"Doomsday Valley just launched on Kickstarter!","summary":"The Mystery of Doomsday Valley just launched on Kickstarter! Together we can make this game a reality. We need every hand on board for this one! Make sure to check out the campaign right away as there are a few limited rewards. It’s a mystery point and click game with hand-drawn animations and object-based puzzles. There is a playable demo if you want to take it out for a spin before you pledge. https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/trueascension/the-mystery-of-doomsday-valley","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-05-13T10:58:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1799088287987112","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3268020-1799088287800537","game_id":"steam-3268020","kind":"announcement","title":"Play the Demo!","summary":"Today we release a demo of our beloved new game - The Mystery of Doomsday Valley. Take it out for a spin - the closed beta testers have responded well so far and seems to like the direction. That is what they are telling us anyway... Demo This demo showcases what we want to achieve with Doomsday Valley, but it should be viewed as a work in progress and an early version. The final product will be even better and more polished, but this will give you a first impression about how the game will play","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-05-07T13:34:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1799088287800537","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:07:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3268020":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:24:14Z","status":"ok","all_sources_check